          "end": 221.67000000000002,
          "en": "up here of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 221.67000000000002,
          "end": 224.22,
          "en": "So from the recipes folder, then recipe detail",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 224.22,
          "end": 226.47,
          "en": "and then the recipe detail component file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 226.47,
          "end": 230.01,
